                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Westover",
                        "email": "jwestover@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "j-westover"
                    },
                    "message": "Updated the patch:\n* Changed \"b-overlay\" \u2192 \"b-modal\"\n* Now matching the Vue 2 $bvModal.msgBoxConfirm() appearance\n* Changed variant styling (danger, primary, secondary) \u2192 (primary default, danger, secondary)  In this case, on the Dumps page, the \"Delete dump\" button changes from red back to blue.\n* Added cleanup in beforeUnmount()\n* Moved vertical position to top (not v-centered) matching Vue 2 behavior\n\nIt would be nice to be able to attach screenshots here.  Does it look better?  Not sure.  But now the same as we had in Vue 2."
                },
                {
