                        "email": "jwestover@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "j-westover"
                    },
                    "message": "Thank you @vedangimittal3004@gmail.com for testing and pointing out the accessibility issue.  \n\nI updated the patch, the modal now using the proper :focus attribute.  Now, on the dumps page autofocus will go to the checkbox, otherwise it goes to the Cancel button by default.\n\nI deleted src/views/Logs/Dumps/DumpsModalConfirmation.vue and instead added an Optional checkbox confirmation to the dialog.  I also allowed multi-line support for the message."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/views/Logs/Dumps/Dumps.vue",
                    "line": 351,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vedangi Mittal",
                        "email": "vedangimittal3004@gmail.com",
                        "username": "vedangimittal"
                    },
                    "message": "Working fine now!"
                }
            ],
